---
/**
 * ImplementationNote Component
 * 
 * For documenting personal discoveries and implementation decisions
 * that aren't from external sources.
 * 
 * Usage in MDX:
 * <ImplementationNote>
 *   Through experimentation, I found 512-token chunks performed best for medical PDFs.
 * </ImplementationNote>
 */
---

<aside class="implementation-note not-prose my-4 p-4 bg-slate-50 rounded-lg border-l-2 border-slate-300">
  <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
    <span class="text-slate-600 font-semibold text-sm uppercase tracking-wide">Implementation Note</span>
  </div>
  <div class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-600">
    <slot />
  </div>
</aside>
